bad news</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1993</year><volume>341</volume><fpage>476</fpage><lpage>478</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||341|476||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8094499</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Girgis</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanson-Fisher</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Breaking bad news: consensus guidelines for medical practitioners</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>1995</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>2449</fpage><lpage>2456</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||13|2449||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7666105</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hogbin</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Fallowfield</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Getting it taped: the bad news consultation with cancer patients</article-title><source>Br J Hosp Med</source><year>1989</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>330</fpage><lpage>333</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Hosp Med||41|330||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2720274</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Llewellyn-Thomas</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Patients's health care decision making: A framework for descriptive and experimental investigations</article-title><source>Med Decis Making</source><year>1995</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>101</fpage><lpage>106</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Med Decis Making||15|101||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7783569</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name